label chapter_5:

    scene bg class at bg_fit with dissolve

    show screen chapter_card("Chapter 5", "Something Already Slipping")

    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "One month in."
    thought "I had a plan. Stay invisible."
    thought "It was working."
    thought "And then it wasn't."

    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene bg school_hallway at bg_fit with dissolve

    show sarasmilequiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Three years ago I decided to avoid Sara."
    thought "I started leaving earlier. Taking different routes. Sitting somewhere new at lunch."
    thought "I told myself she wouldn't notice."

    hide sarasmilequiet
    show sarasmiletalk at center_char

    sara "Soo-ah."

    hide sarasmiletalk
    show sarasmilequiet at center_char

    soo "Oh — hey. Running late, sorry—"

    hide sarasmilequiet
    show sarasmiletalk at center_char

    sara "You're always running late lately."
    sara "It's okay. I'll see you in class."

    hide sarasmiletalk
    show sarasmilequiet at center_char

    thought "She smiled, a real smile." 
    thought "That was worse."
    thought "She was giving me room to come back. And I used it to walk away."

    hide sarasmilequiet

    scene bg class at bg_fit with dissolve

    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "I started sitting somewhere else at lunch."
    thought "Answering her messages late. Or not at all."
    thought "Small things, easy to explain away."
    thought "I told myself it wasn't that serious."

    hide sooneutralquiet
    show sarasmilequiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "She watched me cross the room one day."
    thought "I saw her. I didn't turn around."
    thought "That's how most things break."

    $ add_observation("Sara", "Three years ago I walked away and didn't turn around. She watched me go.")

    hide sarasmilequiet
    show minhoquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Min-ho sat at the back of the class."
    thought "He never talked to anyone he didn't have to."
    thought "But I noticed he always finished the exam first."
    thought "And never looked like it cost him anything."

    hide minhoquiet
    show minhotalking at center_char
    minho "You're watching everyone again."
    soo "..."
    hide minhotalking
    show minhoquiet at center_char
    soo "You noticed?"
    hide minhoquiet
    show minhotalking at center_char
    minho "Hard not to."
    minho "You do it like you're taking notes."
    hide minhotalking
    show minhoquiet at center_char
    soo "Maybe I am."
    minho "..."
    hide minhoquiet
    show minhotalking at center_char
    minho "What did you write about me?"
    hide minhotalking
    show minhoquiet at center_char
    soo "That you finish first and never look relieved."
    minho "..."
    hide minhoquiet
    show minhotalking at center_char
    minho "That's accurate."
    hide minhotalking
    show minhoquiet at center_char

    thought "He went back to his book."
    thought "But he'd answered. That was something."

    $ add_observation("Kang Min-ho", "He noticed me watching. Said I do it like I'm taking notes. Didn't seem to mind.")

    hide minhoquiet

    scene bg class at bg_fit with dissolve

    show saraneutraltalk at center_char with dissolve

    sara "Soo-ah, I—"
    hide saraneutraltalk
    show saraneutralquiet at center_char
    soo "Sorry. I need to finish these problems."
    sara "..."

    thought "She stopped talking." 
    thought "The silence between us was heavier than before."
    thought "I'd made it that way."

    hide saraneutralquiet

    scene bg school_hallway at bg_fit with dissolve

    show woosmile at center_char with dissolve

    woo "You keep looking at Soo-ah and Sara during break."

    hide woosmile
    show jihotalking at center_char with dissolve

    jiho "They're hard to ignore. Soo-ah is being cold."
    jiho "Sara keeps trying and Soo-ah just pushes her away."

    hide jihotalking
    show woosmiletalk at center_char

    woo "Doesn't she look scared to you? More than cold."

    jiho "..."
    
    hide woosmiletalk
    show jihotalking at center_char

    jiho "Maybe."

    hide jihotalking
    show jihoquiet at center_char

    jiho "..."

    hide jihoquiet

    scene bg room at bg_fit with dissolve

    show saraneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    "A few days later. Sara's brother found her sitting quietly in her room."

    "What's wrong?"

    hide saraneutralquiet
    show saraneutraltalk at center_char

    sara "...I think Soo-ah is avoiding me."
    sara "She keeps cutting conversations short."
    sara "Does she not want to be friends anymore?"

    hide saraneutraltalk
    show saraquiet at center_char

    "Just talk to her. You've known each other since you were little."

    hide saraquiet
    show saraneutraltalk at center_char

    sara "...Okay. I'll go now."

    hide saraneutraltalk

    scene black with dissolve

    show saraneutraltalk at center_char with dissolve

    sara "Soo-ah, I need to talk to you—"

    hide saraneutraltalk
    show saraquiet at center_char
    
    soo "Just go away!"

    hide saraquiet
    show saradisturbed at center_char with dissolve

    thought "She came to fix things."
    thought "I didn't let her."

    hide saradisturbed

    scene black with dissolve

    thought "She stopped trying after that."
    thought "And I let her stop."
    thought "That was the worst part."

    $ add_observation("Sara", "She came to fix things. I turned her away. She stopped trying after that. I let her.")

    scene bg school_hallway at bg_fit with dissolve

    show saraneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Two weeks later she found me in the hallway."
    thought "I don't know what made her try again."
    thought "But she did."

    hide saraneutralquiet
    show saraneutraltalk at center_char
    sara "Soo-ah."
    hide saraneutraltalk
    show saraneutralquiet at center_char
    soo "..."
    hide saraneutralquiet
    show saraneutraltalk at center_char
    sara "I don't know what I did."
    sara "But whatever it was — I'm sorry."
    hide saraneutraltalk
    show saraneutralquiet at center_char
    soo "Sara, you didn't—"
    hide saraneutralquiet
    show saraneutraltalk at center_char
    sara "I know you've been avoiding me."
    sara "I just want to know if we're okay."
    hide saraneutraltalk
    show saraneutralquiet at center_char
    soo "..."

    thought "She was apologizing."
    thought "For something she didn't even do."
    thought "Because she thought it was her fault."
    thought "That was the moment I understood what I'd actually done."

    soo "We're okay."
    soo "I'm sorry. It was me. Not you."
    sara "..."
    hide saraneutralquiet
    show sarasmiletalk at center_char
    sara "Okay."
    sara "That's enough for me."
    hide sarasmiletalk
    show sarasmilequiet

    thought "She smiled."
    thought "Like she'd been waiting a long time to hear it."
    thought "We didn't talk about it again after that."
    thought "We just... went back to normal."
    thought "Or something close enough to it."

    $ add_observation("Sara", "She apologized for something she didn't do. I told her it was me. She said that's enough. We went back to normal.")

    hide sarasmilequiet

    scene black with dissolve

    thought "That was three years ago."
    thought "We made up. We moved on."
    thought "But I never forgot what I did."
    thought "And I don't think she fully forgot either."
    thought "Some things heal and still leave a mark."

    jump chapter_6


label chapter_6:

    scene bg room at bg_fit with dissolve

    show screen chapter_card("Chapter 6", "Guilt Without Confrontation")

    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Back to now."
    thought "We made up three years ago. We're fine."
    thought "Or we're supposed to be fine."
    thought "The thing about guilt is it doesn't care that you've been forgiven."
    thought "It just sits there anyway."
    thought "Reminding you of who you were before you fixed it."

    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene bg school at bg_fit with dissolve

    show sarasmiletalk at center_char with dissolve

    sara "You look tired."
    hide sarasmiletalk
    show sarasmilequiet at center_char
    soo "Didn't sleep well."
    hide sarasmilequiet
    show saraneutraltalk at center_char
    sara "Again?"
    hide saraneutraltalk
    show saraneutralquiet at center_char
    soo "I keep thinking about old things."
    sara "..."
    hide saraneutralquiet
    show saraneutraltalk at center_char
    sara "The old things are done, Soo-ah."
    hide saraneutraltalk
    show saraneutralquiet at center_char
    soo "I know."
    hide saraneutralquiet
    show saraneutraltalk at center_char
    sara "Do you?"
    hide saraneutraltalk
    show saraneutralquiet at center_char
    soo "..."
    hide saraneutralquiet
    show saraneutraltalk at center_char
    sara "Eat your lunch."
    hide saraneutraltalk
    show sarasmilequiet at center_char

    thought "She smiles so gently."
    
    $ add_observation("Sara", "I said I'm thinking about old things. She said eat your lunch. She's always waiting.")

    hide sarasmilequiet

    scene bg school_hallway at bg_fit with dissolve

    show jihoquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Ji-ho was in the library. I sat down without asking. He made space without being asked."
    thought "We'd developed a rhythm. Neither of us named it."

    hide jihoquiet
    show jihotalking at center_char
    jiho "You've been on the same page for twenty minutes."
    hide jihotalking
    show jihoquiet at center_char
    soo "I'm thinking."
    hide jihoquiet
    show jihotalking at center_char
    jiho "About what?"
    hide jihotalking 
    show jihoquiet at center_char
    soo "Something I did a long time ago."
    hide jihoquiet
    show jihotalking at center_char
    jiho "Does thinking about it change it?"
    hide jihotalking
    show jihoquiet at center_char
    soo "No."
    hide jihoquiet
    show jihotalking at center_char
    jiho "Then stop."
    hide jihotalking
    show jihoquiet at center_char
    soo "It's not that simple."
    jiho "..."
    hide jihoquiet
    show jihotalking at center_char
    jiho "No. I know."
    hide jihotalking
    show jihoquiet at center_char

    thought "He said it like he had his own version of it."

    $ add_observation("Ji-ho", "He said stop thinking about old things. Then said he knows it's not that simple.")

    hide jihoquiet

    scene bg class at bg_fit with dissolve

    show woosmiletalk at center_char with dissolve

    woo "You're usually quiet and watching. Today you're just quiet."
    hide woosmiletalk
    show wooquiet at center_char
    soo "Is there a difference?"
    hide wooquiet
    show woosmiletalk at center_char
    woo "When you're watching you're present." 
    woo "Right now you're somewhere else."
    hide woosmiletalk
    show wooquiet at center_char
    soo "Ju-in, if you hurt someone a long time ago and you've been trying to fix it.. does that count?"
    hide wooquiet
    show woosmiletalk at center_char
    woo "Depends on whether the person knows you're trying."
    woo "Fixing things quietly doesn't always reach people." 
    woo "Sometimes you have to say it out loud."
    hide woosmiletalk
    show wooquiet at center_char
    soo "What if you don't know how?"
    hide wooquiet
    show woosmiletalk at center_char
    woo "Start with something small.. and don't stop."
    hide woosmiletalk
    show woosmile at center_char

    $ add_observation("Woo Ju-in", "He said fixing things quietly doesn't reach people. Start small and don't stop.")

    hide woosmile

    scene bg school at bg_fit with dissolve

    show minhoquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "Min-ho was reading on the steps. I sat beside him."

    hide minhoquiet
    show minhotalking at center_char
    minho "Something's bothering you."
    hide minhotalking
    show minhoquiet at center_char
    soo "I did something a long time ago." 
    soo "I don't think you can undo things."
    soo "I think you can only build something new on top of them."
    hide minhoquiet
    show minhotalking at center_char
    minho "That's more accurate than most people get."
    minho "Pretending costs more in the long run."
    hide minhotalking
    show minhoquiet at center_char

    thought "He shifted slightly toward me. Just slightly. Like proximity was the thing he could offer."

    $ add_observation("Kang Min-ho", "Pretending costs more in the long run. He shifted closer without saying anything.")

    hide minhoquiet

    scene bg room at bg_fit with dissolve

    show sooneutralquiet at center_char with dissolve

    thought "That night I wrote it all down."
    thought "Start small, don't stop." 
    thought "You can't undo things — build on top of them."
    thought "Does thinking about it change it? No. So stop."
    thought "Tomorrow I'm going to say something out loud." 
    thought "And I'm not going to stop."

    hide sooneutralquiet

    scene black with dissolve

    jump chapter_6_extras
